        "pkcontributionId": 118847,
        "bookId": 63,
        "chapterId": 55,
        "headingId": 705,
        "headingText": "\r\n\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2024-03-01T12:46:19"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 769,
    "bookid": 63,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 706,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 118848,
        "bookId": 63,
        "chapterId": 55,
        "headingId": 706,
        "headingText": "\r\n\r\n<p>This leukaemia predominantly involves the peripheral blood and bone marrow.</p>\r\n\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2024-03-01T12:46:19"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 770,
    "bookid": 63,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 707,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 118849,
        "bookId": 63,
        "chapterId": 55,
        "headingId": 707,
        "headingText": "\r\n\r\n<p>Patients usually present with symptoms related to cytopenias, including fatigue. Some may present with peripheral blood leukocytosis with circulating blasts and promonocytes.</p>\r\n\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2024-03-01T12:46:19"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 771,
    "bookid": 63,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 708,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 118850,
        "bookId": 63,
        "chapterId": 55,
        "headingId": 708,
        "headingText": "\r\n\r\n<p>Acute myelomonocytic leukaemia occurs in all age groups, although it is more common in adults. There are limited data using the current definition criteria.</p>\r\n\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2024-03-01T12:46:19"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 772,
    "bookid": 63,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 709,
    "contributions": [
      {
